{"id":"n62506-1-8","stage":1,"title":"산책 · 散步","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62506-1-8-1","ko":"어디 다녀오세요?","zh":"您去哪儿了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다녀오세요?","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去了趟","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0c30ed5a4ade62c18c06.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62506-1-8-2","ko":"네, 강아지하고 뒷산에 산책을 갔다 오는 길이에요.","zh":"我刚带小狗去后山散步，正在回来的路上。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"강아지하고","meaning":"小狗，狗崽","explanation":"강아지：小狗，狗崽；하고：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"강아지","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15689","senseId":"1","lemma":"강아지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒷산에","meaning":"后山","explanation":"뒷산：后山；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"뒷산","audio":"/audio/67e40a6de3acce11076e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67401","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒷산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"산책을","meaning":"散步","explanation":"산책：散步；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"산책","audio":"/audio/b745d43721954853192d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62506","senseId":"1","lemma":"산책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔다","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오는","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"길이에요.","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"94e82412553f09dd","term":"강아지","zh":"小狗，狗崽","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3","entryId":"15689","definition":"狗的崽子。","pronunciation":["강아지"]},{"id":"67e40a6de3acce11","term":"뒷산","zh":"后山","audio":"/audio/67e40a6de3acce11076e.mp3","entryId":"67401","definition":"家或村子后面的山。","pronunciation":["뒤ː싼","뒫ː싼"]},{"id":"b745d43721954853","term":"산책","zh":"散步","audio":"/audio/b745d43721954853192d.mp3","entryId":"62506","definition":"为了稍作休息或身体健康而在附近慢慢地走路。","pronunciation":["산ː책"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路上","audio"